              <calculation class='tableau' formula='case [Number]&#13;&#10;WHEN 1 then &apos;예상 입고 수량&apos;&#13;&#10;WHEN 2 then &apos;실입고 수량&apos;&#13;&#10;WHEN 3 then &apos;정확도&apos;&#13;&#10;END' />
